constant coefficient tensor map are the original b followed by E's original left-unit insertion. -/
theorem generatorInsertion_leftUnit {O E : ColoredOperadObj W C} (u : O ⟶ E) (B : W → C)
    (b : ∀ c, B c ⟶ E.toCollection.obj (ColoredProfile.nullary c)) (c : W) :
    generatorInsertion O B c ≫
