canonical enveloping algebra map to the original identity restriction. -/
theorem canonicalEnvelopingAlgebraMap_unique (O : ColoredOperadObj W C) {A B : Algebra O} (f
  : A ⟶ B)
    (h : canonicalEnvelopingAlgebra O A ⟶ Algebra.restrict (envelopingOperadMap O f)
      (canonicalEnvelopingAlgebra O B)) :
    h = canonicalEnvelopingAlgebraMap O f :=
  (canonicalEnvelopingAlgebraIsInitial O A).hom_ext _ _


