algebra map is retained literally in its actual original under-A arrow. -/
theorem envelopingUnderAMap_hom (O : ColoredOperadObj W C) (A : Algebra O)
    {M N : Algebra (envelopingOperad O A)} (f : M ⟶ N) :
    (envelopingUnderAMap O A f).right.hom = f.hom := rfl

